{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"nouns"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Noun","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Noun","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The phrases to join, in the order they should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read."}]}],"name":"nouns"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One noun standing for all of them."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That number is the reason this is here and not at the call site."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English agrees with the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"list"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and a list is plural two ways: when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it holds more than one thing, "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or"}]},{"type":"text","text":" when the only thing it holds is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"itself plural. Counting alone gets the second wrong, and the engine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"got it wrong — one plural thing in a box printed “In the hamper is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"some scales.” A game re-voicing that line would have had to re-derive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rule from scratch and could have made the same mistake; this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rule written once, in the type that exists to own it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty list is plural (“none of them are here”) and renders as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty phrase. No stock line calls one with nothing in it — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callers all branch on empty first, with a line of their own — but a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s might, and silently reading as singular would be the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defect one case further out."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun\/list(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"list(_:)","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV4listyAESayAEGFZ","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Noun"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Noun"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Several nouns as one — “a sword, a lamp, and some scales” — carrying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the number the whole phrase has rather than the number any one of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them has.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/noun\/list(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TextAndRandomness":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness","title":"Text and Randomness","abstract":[{"text":"Re-skin the engine’s stock lines, and roll dice that replay.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/textandrandomness","type":"topic"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText/Noun":{"title":"GameText.Noun","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/noun","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rendered noun phrase that also knows its own number, for the lines"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose verb has to agree with it."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Noun"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Noun"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameText"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","title":"GameText","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameText"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every stock player-facing line the engine can say, as one overridable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value — so a game can speak in its own voice without touching behavior."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText/Noun/list(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"list","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Noun","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Noun","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun\/list(_:)","title":"list(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/noun\/list(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Several nouns as one — “a sword, a lamp, and some scales” — carrying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the number the whole phrase has rather than the number any one of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them has."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto":{"title":"Gnusto","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto","abstract":[{"text":"An engine for writing interactive fiction in Swift.